# guestCrossSurfaceNav — Manifest Schema (Documentation)

**Decision:** DL-05, DL-37  
**Phase:** PS-4 / BP-3b  
**Implementation:** Schema lands in `workspace.manifest.json` guest extensions — **JSON Schema update is a separate implementation PR**. This document is the architectural contract.

---

## 1. Ownership

| Aspect | Owner |
| ------ | ----- |
| Schema definition | Platform (`workspace-sdk` codegen) |
| Link labels + ordering | Workspace manifest |
| Path validity | Platform codegen (surface allowlist) |
| Rendering | `apps/marketing` shell (header/footer) |
| Portal header egress | GSH builders — not manifest absolute URLs |

---

## 2. Manifest location

```json
{
  "guestExtensionsVersion": 1,
  "guestCrossSurfaceNav": {
    "version": 1,
    "links": [ /* GuestCrossSurfaceNavLink[] */ ]
  }
}
```

**Replaces:** `FULL_LANDING_NAV_LINKS` in `apps/marketing/src/shell/marketing-shell.tsx`.

---

## 3. Field definitions

### 3.1 `guestCrossSurfaceNav` object

| Field | Type | Required | Description |
| ----- | ---- | -------- | ----------- |
| `version` | `integer` | Yes | Schema version — **must be `1`** |
| `links` | `array` | Yes | Ordered nav links — max **8** (soft warn at 6) |

### 3.2 `GuestCrossSurfaceNavLink` object

| Field | Type | Required | Description |
| ----- | ---- | -------- | ----------- |
| `id` | `string` | Yes | Stable id — `[a-z][a-z0-9-]{1,31}` |
| `labelKey` | `string` | Yes | i18n key under workspace marketing namespace |
| `surface` | `"marketing"` \| `"portal_egress"` | Yes | Target surface class |
| `path` | `string` | Conditional | Relative path on **marketing** host — required when `surface=marketing` |
| `egress` | `"member_module"` \| `"marketing_home"` \| `"marketing_tours"` | Conditional | Required when `surface=portal_egress` — resolved via GSH at render |
| `memberModuleId` | `string` | Conditional | **Required** when `egress=member_module` — must exist in effective `memberPortal` registry (`home` or workspace module id) |
| `visibleWhen` | `"always"` \| `"club"` \| `"platform_mother"` | No (default `club`) | Host visibility rule (DL-37) |

---

## 4. Validation rules (codegen fail-closed)

| Rule | Error code |
| ---- | ---------- |
| Duplicate `id` | `GCSN-DUP-ID` |
| `surface=marketing` + path starts with `/me` | `GCSN-PORTAL-PATH` |
| `surface=marketing` + path `/tours` on portal manifest block | `GCSN-WRS-PATH-02` |
| `visibleWhen=club` + path in platform-mother-only set | `GCSN-404-RISK` |
| Absolute URL in `path` | `GCSN-ABSOLUTE` |
| `portal_egress` + raw path | `GCSN-EGRESS-PATH` |
| `egress=member_module` without `memberModuleId` | `GCSN-MISSING-MEMBER-MODULE-ID` |
| `memberModuleId` not in effective registry | `GCSN-UNKNOWN-MEMBER-MODULE-ID` |
| `memberModuleId` ∈ `{ more, api, catalog }` | `GCSN-RESERVED-MEMBER-MODULE-ID` |
| `memberModuleId` on non-`member_module` egress | `GCSN-MEMBER-MODULE-ID-EGRESS` |

### 4.1 Platform-mother-only paths

When `visibleWhen` is **`club`** (default), these paths **fail** validation:

- `/about`
- `/contact`
- `/pricing`

When `visibleWhen` is **`platform_mother`**, allowed.

---

## 5. Examples

### 5.1 Denali club tenant (safe)

```json
{
  "guestCrossSurfaceNav": {
    "version": 1,
    "links": [
      {
        "id": "home",
        "labelKey": "nav.home",
        "surface": "marketing",
        "path": "/",
        "visibleWhen": "club"
      },
      {
        "id": "tours",
        "labelKey": "nav.tours",
        "surface": "marketing",
        "path": "/tours",
        "visibleWhen": "club"
      },
      {
        "id": "my-trips",
        "labelKey": "nav.myTrips",
        "surface": "portal_egress",
        "egress": "member_module",
        "memberModuleId": "trips",
        "visibleWhen": "always"
      }
    ]
  }
}
```

**Render:** `member_module` → `resolvePortalMemberModuleUrl(host, link.memberModuleId)` at marketing render boundary.

### 5.2 Platform mother (about link)

```json
{
  "id": "about",
  "labelKey": "nav.about",
  "surface": "marketing",
  "path": "/about",
  "visibleWhen": "platform_mother"
}
```

---

## 6. Future compatibility

| Version | Change |
| ------- | ------ |
| `1` | Initial — marketing + portal_egress |
| `2` (reserved) | Locale-prefixed path templates; footer-only links |

**Rule:** Codegen rejects unknown `guestCrossSurfaceNav.version` until RFC amends schema.

